(Section 4: Family and Medical Leave Act \(FMLA\) & Parental Leave Policy) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
T*
T*
/F2 11 Tf
(4.1 Eligibility Criteria) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(All full-time and part-time regular employees are eligible for FMLA coverage if they) Tj
T*
(have:) Tj
T*
(\(a\) Completed at least twelve \(12\) consecutive months of service with Acme Global.) Tj
T*
(\(b\) Worked a minimum of 1,250 hours during the previous twelve-month period.) Tj
T*
(\(c\) Work at a facility with fifty \(50\) or more employees within a 75-mile radius.) Tj
T*
T*
T*
/F2 11 Tf
(4.2 Parental Bonding Leave Duration and Compensation) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
/F2 14 Tf
(Acme Global provides up to twelve \(12\) weeks of job-protected parental leave for the birth, adoption, or foster placement of a child.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(\(a\) Primary and secondary caregivers are entitled to twelve \(12\) weeks of fully) Tj
T*
(subsidized employer leave at 100% of standard base salary.) Tj
T*
(\(b\) California and New York residents may coordinate with state Paid Family Leave) Tj
T*
(\(PFL\) funds for supplemental wage replacement.) Tj
T*
(\(c\) Leave must be taken within twelve \(12\) months following the qualifying birth or) Tj
T*
(placement event.) Tj
T*
T*
T*
/F2 11 Tf
(4.3 Intermittent Leave and Medical Certification) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Employees requiring non-consecutive or reduced-schedule leave for serious health) Tj
T*
(conditions or family care must furnish Department of Labor Form WH-380-F signed by) Tj
T*
(an authorized healthcare provider within fifteen \(15\) calendar days of request.) Tj
T*
(Intermittent leave schedules must be registered under ADP tracking code FMLA-INT.) Tj
T*
